  <p id="c-songshu-046-zhangyan-complete:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-046-zhangyan-complete:p001:m0000" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAABAA">浩</persName>弟<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhangyan-complete:p001:m0002" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAABAB">淹</persName>，黃門郎，封廣晉縣子，太子左衞率，東陽太守。逼郡吏燒臂照佛，百姓有罪，使禮佛贖刑，動至數千拜。免官禁錮。起為光祿勳，與<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhangyan-complete:p001:m0062" ref="902_55f_656">晉安王子勛</persName>同逆，軍敗見殺焉。</p>
</text>
